WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 01e55797f6d7badd90ea909a2a995db9

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:03.680
Karibu tena. Hadi sasa, umejifunza keyword mbili,

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:07.760
maagizo mawili ambayo Jiki anaweza kuelewa, let na

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.720
repeat. Katika video hii, tutajifunza

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:12.820
agizo jipya, keyword mpya, na ni

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.570
keyword inayotusaidia kumwambia Jiki

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:20.400
afanye mambo tu katika hali fulani. Labda unaandika

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:22.850
msimbo wa kulinda mlango wa

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:25.510
baa, labda wewe ni mlinzi wa mlango, na Jiki anapaswa

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:28.880
kufungua mlango tu ikiwa mtu amevaa ipasavyo.

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:32.470
Au labda unaandika msimbo ambapo wewe ndiye

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:34.990
unayeshughulikia kupeperusha bendera yenye mraba mraba

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:38.110
mwishoni mwa mbio, lakini Jiki anahitaji

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:39.740
kujua kwamba anapaswa kufanya hivyo tu

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:43.220
kwenye mzunguko wa mwisho. Katika hali

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:46.080
kama hizi, tutatumia keyword ya if.

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:50.160
Tunatumia keyword ya if kwa mtindo

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:53.320
unaofanana sana na ule wa repeat. Tunaweka

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:56.400
taarifa fulani ndani ya mabano ya kawaida. Katika kesi hii,

00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:59.260
taarifa hiyo ni sharti tunalokagua.

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:00.600
Tutalizungumzia zaidi baada ya muda mfupi.

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:03.040
Na kisha tunaweka kizuizi cha msimbo

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:06.100
ndani ya mabano yaliyopinda ambacho tunaendesha

00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:10.520
tu ikiwa sharti hilo ni kweli. Sasa,

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:13.620
masharti haya yanaonekanaje? Kwa kawaida, huwa ni

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:16.580
aina fulani ya ulinganisho. Tunalinganisha namba mbili

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:19.300
au string mbili na kuangalia kama matokeo ni

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:23.580
kweli au sikweli. Kwa hivyo, fikiri kuhusu haya kama

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:26.580
kauli ambazo unaweza kuzisema kwa sauti. Tatu

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:30.620
ni chini ya tano. Hiyo ni kweli. Saba ni

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:35.420
chini ya mbili. Hiyo ni sikweli. Tunatumia alama

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:38.480
kuandika ulinganisho huu. Huenda tayari

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:41.040
unazifahamu kutoka kwenye hisabati. Tuna chini

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:44.140
ya, kubwa kuliko, chini ya au sawa na,

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:46.940
kubwa kuliko au sawa na, na

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:48.600
pia tuna alama ya kuangalia kama vitu

00:01:48.610 --> 00:01:51.570
viwili ni sawa, yaani kama vinafanana. Na

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:54.360
hii ni tofauti kidogo na kile

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:58.440
ulichozoea, kwa sababu tunatumia alama tatu za sawa

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:00.580
mfululizo kuona kama vitu viwili

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:04.040
ni sawa au ni tofauti. Na hii

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:06.820
inatusaidia tusichanganye na wakati tunapoweka

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:09.720
au kubadilisha thamani ya variable, ambapo tunatumia

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:11.540
alama moja ya sawa kumaanisha weka hii

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:15.900
kwenye sanduku. Kumbuka tu: alama tatu za sawa kwa kulinganisha.

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:21.140
Unaweza pia kulinganisha string. Kwa hivyo hello

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:24.630
ni sawa na hello. Hiyo ni kweli. String hizo mbili

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:27.300
zinafanana. Lakini kuwa mwangalifu hapa, kwa sababu Jiki

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:31.320
hulinganisha kila herufi katika string zote mbili,

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:34.720
kwenye karatasi zote mbili. Kwa hivyo Hello yenye

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:38.420
H kubwa si sawa na hello yenye

00:02:38.430 --> 00:02:41.430
h ndogo. Ni string tofauti. Kwa hivyo kulinganisha

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:44.000
hizo kutakuwa sikweli, kwa sababu H kubwa

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:49.290
na h ndogo ni herufi tofauti.

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:51.390
Na kumbuka: kweli na sikweli

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:56.230
huitwa Booleans, nalo ni neno lingine linalosikika kiufundi. Lakini

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:58.370
ni rahisi sana. Ni njia rasmi tu

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:01.080
ya kusema kwamba kitu ni kweli au

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:03.220
sikweli. Kwa hivyo ukinisikia nikisema Booleans

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:05.530
au mtu mwingine akisema Booleans, inamaanisha tu

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:09.020
kweli au sikweli. Sawa, hebu tuone hili

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:12.660
likifanya kazi. Fikiria tunatengeneza yule mlinzi wa mlango wa roboti

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:15.360
kwa ajili ya kilabu, na tutasema mlinzi

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:18.220
anapaswa kufungua mlango tu ikiwa mtu

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:22.560
ana umri wa miaka 21 au zaidi. Kwa hivyo tuna

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:25.000
kitendakazi askAge (uliza umri), ambacho tunaweza kutumia

00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:27.320
kupata umri wa mtu, na tutahifadhi

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:29.660
matokeo yake kwenye variable inayoitwa age (umri).

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:32.620
Na kisha tunaweza kusema, ikiwa age hiyo

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:35.840
ni kubwa kuliko 20, tutafungua mlango.

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:40.260
Kwa hivyo ikiwa askAge inarejesha 30, tunaufungua,

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:43.620
na ikiwa inarejesha 12, hatuufungui.

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:47.549
Katika zoezi linalofuata, utatumia

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:50.920
kauli ya masharti ya if kufanya maamuzi katika msimbo wako.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:54.120
Utakagua masharti na kuendesha msimbo fulani tu

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:57.420
pale masharti hayo yanapokuwa kweli. Mazoezi mawili yajayo

00:03:57.430 --> 00:03:59.360
ni rahisi kiasi, kisha tutaendelea

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:02.210
na mengine machache magumu zaidi. Kama

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:05.109
kawaida, kila kitu katika mazoezi haya kinatumia yale

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:07.240
ambayo tumeshazungumzia. Ukijikuta umepotea kidogo,

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:09.160
angalia viungo vya dhana vilivyo chini ya

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:11.960
maelekezo, ujikumbushe chochote ambacho

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:14.200
huenda umesahau. Kila la heri, na tutaonana

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:14.990
hapa tena hivi karibuni.
